          "htmlContent": "",
          "markdownContent": "### LLM Token Consumption\n\n`agent_llm_tokens_total{provider,model,direction}` \u2014 provider-reported token usage emitted by the always-on agent-platform token middleware (**SPEC-065 R-1**) and pushed as an OTel instrument (**R-2**). `direction` is bounded to `input`, `output`, `cache_input`, `cache_creation`.\n\n**No dollar-cost panel**: agentscope 2.0.8 reports no provider-derived cost and the platform has no price table, so the cost metric is deferred (R-1) rather than fabricated. **Requires `OTEL_ENABLED=true`.**"
        },
